{"message":"Your three debit cards ending in 4582, 7391, and 8624 have been permanently closed for security. Any already-authorized pending transactions may still process, and recurring payments linked to those cards will need to be updated.

I found that the card linked to your Green Account can be replaced immediately with expedited delivery for a $15 delivery fee; the classic design is free. The Light Blue and Light Green accounts require a 48-hour wait after closure and only offer free standard shipping.

Before I place the immediately available order, please confirm that you want it mailed to 3245 Sunset Boulevard, San Diego, CA 92103, and that you authorize the $15 expedited-delivery fee. I can then order that replacement, and the other two can be ordered after the waiting period."}
